	</p>
</section>

<style>

	body {
		margin: 0;
		min-height: 100vh;
		position: relative;
	}

	body::before {
		content: "";
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		background-image: url('/skybg.jpg');
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
		background-repeat: no-repeat;
		z-index: -1;
	}

	body::after {
		content: "";
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.60);
